<item><title>26/84 Woodend Beach Toilet Block Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the demolition of the existing toilet block at Woodend Beach Domain and the construction of a new 4 bay toilet block.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2728<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 4]]></description>
