<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:52:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
</item>
<item><title>26/47 Minor Road Safety Improvements</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> A collection of minor roading improvements that consists of the following:<br /><br />- Construction of new pedestrian cut downs to improve pedestrian facilities<br /><br />- Construction of Intersection Splitter Islands<br /><br />- Construction of minor areas of footpath<br /><br />- Installation of Tactile Ground Surface Indicators (TGSI Pavers)<br /><br />- Signage and Line marking<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2725<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Aimee Hurley Email: aimee.hurley@wmk.govt.nz Tel: 0272716320<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
