<item><title>Source Upgrade Package 2 - Garrymere - Wellhead Construction</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Contract is for the Construction of a new Water Supply Wellhead for Bore No.2 and upgrading of an existing wellhead for Bore No.1 at the Garrymere water headworks site.<br /><br />This includes the supply, installation and commissioning of new electrical and control equipment to enable the operation of the new well pump.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Nov/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2721<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Utilities, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 5]]></description>
