</item>
<item><title>Elder Housing Grounds Maintenance</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Waimakariri District Council is seeking a suitably experienced supplier to provide grounds and garden maintenance services for its Elderly Housing properties. The services are intended to ensure that the grounds and gardens across eight Council-owned sites are maintained to a consistently tidy, safe and well kept standard throughout the contract term.<br /><br />The proposed contract term is five years, with a potential extension of up to a further two years, subject to satisfactory performance and Council approval.<br /><br />Scope of Works are details in the Tender document however a summary includes:<br /><br />1. Lawn moving and edging<br /><br />2. Garden and shrub maintenance<br /><br />3. Hedge trimming and pruning<br /><br />4. Weed and moss control<br /><br />5. Litter and debris removal<br /><br />6. Cleaning of pathways and entrances<br /><br />7. Emergency response as required<br /><br />8. Excludes tree work over 1.8m<br /><br />Why Tender?<br /><br />This contract offers an opportunity for both ...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 25/Nov/2026 05:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2717<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Horticulture & Arboriculture<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/tsi.axd?id=5d49ba2e328c4d2597f61325de6b340ds2717s29f5443f3e2a4ef398c4b08336f19a7cs65</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">5d49ba2e328c4d2597f61325de6b340d</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 20:29:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Horticulture &amp; Arboriculture</category>
</item>
<item><title>Rural Intersection Solar Flag Lighting</title>
