<item><title>26_031 Residential Students Catering Manawatu RFP</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The provider must be able to respond effectively to changes in resident numbers, dietary requirements, student demographics and preferences, while maintaining consistent service quality. The service must be welcoming, inclusive and accessible to both domestic and international residential students and contribute positively to the overall residential experience.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Massey University<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 19/Nov/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2712<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Catering & Hospitality<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 7]]></description>
