<item><title>Data Centre Infrastructure</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> In summary, Massey intends to establish a single preferred supplier capable of quoting, supplying and supporting the full range of data centre infrastructure requirements described below. Current manufacturers and models are identified to provide context on the existing environment. Respondents may propose suitable enterprise-grade alternative technologies where these meet or exceed Massey’s requirements. The ability to propose an alternative technology does not remove the requirement for the respondent to demonstrate capability across the full scope.<br /><br />Core Infrastructure Services<br /><br />Compute Services (Physical & Virtual)<br /><br />•	HPE DL360/DL365/DL385 server fleet<br /><br />•	ESXi host clusters and standalone hosts<br /><br />•	Nutanix clusters (production, dev, legacy)<br /><br />This is primarily delivered as an IaaS capability and is the foundation for most IT services.<br /><br />Storage Services (Enterprise Tiered Storage)<br /><br />•	NetApp AFF A400/A250 (SSD, high-performance)<b...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Massey University<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 20/Nov/2026 10:00 am (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2711<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 3]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/tsi.axd?id=c5378a858da54344a3f971c577044ea3s2711s930449e3ff934542b58ea67687191124s70</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">c5378a858da54344a3f971c577044ea3</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 18:47:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>IT &amp; Telecomms</category>
</item>
<item><title>2026-27 Contractors Briefing</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This is provision of information only. <br /><br />The Utilities and Roading annual Contractors briefing (2026/27) was held on 17th September 2026. This provided notification to contractors of upcoming works, and any changes in the Council's procurement or contracting approaches or any other operational process changes that may be of interest. <br /><br />This tender is to simply share the resultant presentation slides with you.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 31/Dec/2026 05:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2708<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Engineer, Research, Tech services, Utilities, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 1]]></description>
