<item><title>Supply and Installation of Structured Cabling &amp; Related Physical Network Infrastructure</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> Services for design, install, test, certify, and warranty of structured copper and fibre cabling infrastructure—along with the necessary physical infrastructure (cabinets, racks, pathways, and UPS equipment)—across Massey’s three campuses. Delivery of these services must conform to strict technical standards and documentation requirements provided by Massey.<br /><br />The outcome of the procurement is to identify a preferred supplier who can provide the services outlined above at each of the Massey campuses – Auckland, Manawatu, and Wellington.<br /><br />It is further expected that the supplier will also undertake additional tasks required to support the network upgrade programme – such as physically installing wireless access points (APs) and network switches (mounting in ceilings or racks), installing and connecting UPS units, decommissioning old cabling or hardware, and performing cable fault-finding/repair services as needed. (Note: Ongoing maintenance of active network devices is excluded from this cab...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Massey University<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 18/Nov/2026 12:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2700<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : IT & Telecomms<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/tsi.axd?id=f4cdf976faae41f08913e776ebf90bd1s2700s930449e3ff934542b58ea67687191124s70</link>
